# Tracking posture for this repo: track-all (recorded in .dojo/CONTEXT.md → Decisions;
# rationale in .dojo/adr/0005). A human decision — presented at scaffold, applied by the
# human in whichever ignore surface they keep; never edited by the agent unprompted.
# Negations below override ~/.gitignore_global name rules (CONTEXT.md, TASKS.md,
# progress.md, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md — and graphify-out/) so this repo tracks its full
# footprint: the .dojo/ folder and the tool-homed graphify cache alike.
!.dojo/CONTEXT.md
!.dojo/TASKS.md
!.dojo/progress.md
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!graphify-out/